Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.53,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}我搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.78,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}我脫口而出  叫了她上小學時候的外號
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:19.83,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}難得人家還邀請我參加同好會
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.41,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}我卻非常隨意地拒絕了人家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:25.29,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}就算是要拒絕人家 明明還有更好的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:26.83,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}我的維持現狀精神又在作祟了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.09,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}她肯定討厭我了~~~~~~~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:31.75,Screen,,0,0,150,,{\an2\bord3\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fsp8}想向她道歉 可是卻忘記了問聯絡方式…
